ask enriched with botanical herbs, Aloe vera extract, Pomegranate Extract, Bearberry extract. It reduces the transfer of melanin to the skin, making skin fairer, smoother and softer.</li></ul><h4>Directions To Use</h4><ul class="desc-directions"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Apply on wet face and neck, gently massage with circular movements, wash off with water.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Add 2-3 drops of Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum with the cream to apply all over face &amp; neck. Moisten hand with cold water, gently massage for 10-15 minutes &amp; remove with damp cotton.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Add 2-3 drop in Massage Cream &amp; Face Pack. Also apply after facial for extra glow.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply on cleanse face, gently massage the gel. Avoid contact with eyes.</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply on face and neck, Avoiding Eyes, let it dry Wash off with plain water.</li></ul><h4>Key Ingredients</h4><p><em>*This Product is Non-Vegan Formulation*</em></p><p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p><ul class="desc-ingredients"><li>Purified Water</li><li>Glycerine</li><li>Cetostearyl Alcohol</li><li>Light Liquid Paraffin</li><li>Glyceryl Monostearate</li><li>Aloe Vera Extract</li><li>Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter)</li><li>Sesame Oil</li><li>Cetyl Alcohol</li><li>Polyethylene Scrub</li><li>Stearic Acid</li><li>Mulberry (Morus alba) Extract</li><li>Liquorice (Glycyrrhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Polysorbate 80</li><li>Glyceryl Stearate</li><li>Polyethylene Glycol 100 Stearate</li><li>Perfume</li><li>Phenoxyethanol</li><li>Methylparaben</li><li>Propylparaben</li><li>Allantoin</li><li>Disodium Ethylenediaminetetra Acetic Acid</li><li>Beeswax Bleached</li><li>Sweet Almond</li><li>(Prunus amygdalus</li><li>dulcis) Oil</li><li>Emulsifying Wax</li><li>Isopropyl Myristate</li><li>Papaya (Carica papaya) Extract</li><li>Cyclomethicone</li><li>Tomato (Solanum lycopersicum) Fruit Extract</li><li>Carrot Extract</li><li>Fenugreek (Ingonella foenumgraecum) Extract</li><li>Xylitylglucoside</li><li>Anhydroxylitol</li><li>Xylitol</li><li>Vitamin E</li><li>Liqourice (Glycyrrhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Green Tea (Camellia sinensis) Extract</li><li>Sodium Acrylates Copolymer</li></ul><h4>Important Considerations</h4><p><strong>Note:</strong> Use only as directed. Avoid contact with eyes. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a physician.</p>";}i:128;a:11:{s:2:"id";i:153;s:4:"slug";s:39:"pearl-skin-whitening-therapy-facial-kit";s:4:"name";s:43:"PEARL SKIN WHITENING THERAPY – FACIAL KIT";s:8:"category";s:32:"private-label-skin-care-products";s:11:"subcategory";s:12:"facials-kits";s:5:"price";d:11.18;s:6:"rating";d:4.5;s:7:"reviews";i:0;s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:63:"uploads/products/pearl-skin-whitening-therapy-facial-kit/01.jpg";s:11:"description";s:3779:"<h3>Description</h3><ul class="desc-steps"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> – Pearl Gentle Exfoliating Facial Scrub : This Scrub consist of botanical herbs, Aloe vera extract, Neem Extract, Manjiestha extract and Liquorice ( Glycyrhiza Glabra) Extract to prevent skin from acne and pimples. This Oil control Scrub penetrate deep into the skin to clean clogged pores and removes Pimples and acne leaving you with a clean, soft and smooth skin .</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Pearl Energizing Cream: Pearl energizing cream help to improve blood circulation restore softness and smoothness. This excellent energizing cream improves cell regeneration and clear pimple and skin eruption. The cream nourishes, hydrates and rejuvenate the skin.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum Moisturises the skin, give extra radiance and instant whitening.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Pearl Massage Gel Pearl Massage Gel helps improve blood circulation restore softness and radiance. The excellent gel improve the quality of cell regeneration and glowing white, making skin younger.</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Pearl Whitening Mask : The absolute oil control mask enriched with herbal extract, Aloevera Extract, Bearberry Extract, Chamomile Extract, Pomegranate extract, cinnamon Leaf extract and pearl powder. It reduces pimple and acne on the skin making skin fairer, clearer and softer.</li></ul><h4>Directions To Use</h4><ul class="desc-directions"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Apply this scrub lavishly all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes upward and downward strokes, wash off with plain water .</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Add 2-3 drops of Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum with the cream to apply all over face &amp; neck. Moisten hand with cold water, gently massage for 10-15 minutes &amp; remove with damp cotton.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Add 2-3 drop in Massage Cream &amp; Face Pack. Also apply after facial for extra glow.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply this gel lavishly all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes upward and downward strokes .</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply a generous amount of this pack on face and neck leaving eyes. Relax till completely dry. Rinse with plain water .</li></ul><h4>Key Ingredients</h4><p><em>*This Product is Non-Vegan Formulation*</em></p><p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p><ul class="desc-ingredients"><li>Purified Water</li><li>Glycerine</li><li>Light Liquid Paraffin</li><li>Cetostearyl Alcohol</li><li>Glyceryl Monostearate</li><li>Aloe Vera Extract</li><li>Scrub Beads</li><li>Neem ( Azadirachta indica) Extract</li><li>Manjistha (Rubia cordifolia) Extract</li><li>Polysorbate 80</li><li>Liquorice ( Glycymhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Glyceryl Stearate</li><li>Polyethylene Glycol 100 Stearate</li><li>Phenoxyethanol</li><li>Methylparaben</li><li>Cinnamon Oil</li><li>Fragrance</li><li>Allantoin</li><li>Propylparaben</li><li>Hydrolyzed Pearl</li><li>Beeswax Bleached</li><li>Emulsifying Wax</li><li>Sweet Almond (Prunus amygdalus dulcis) Oil</li><li>Isopropyl Myristate</li><li>Cetyl Alcohol</li><li>Neem ( Azadirachta</li><li>indica) Extract</li><li>Polyethylene Glycol</li><li>Calendula (Calendula Officinalis) Extract</li><li>Turmeric Extract</li><li>Xylityglucoside</li><li>Vitamin E</li><li>Anhydroxylitol</li><li>Xylitol</li><li>Liqourice (Glycyrrhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Papaya (Carica papaya) Extract</li><li>Green Tea (Camellia sinensis) Extract</li><li>Sodium Acrylates Copolymer</li><li>Glycolic Acid</li><li>Xylityiglucoside</li></ul><h4>Important Considerations</h4><p><strong>Note:</strong> Use only as directed. Avoid contact with eyes. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a physician.</p>";}i:129;a:11:{s:2:"id";i:152;s:4:"slug";s:33:"gold-skin-glow-therapy-facial-kit";s:4:"name";s:37:"GOLD SKIN GLOW THERAPY – FACIAL KIT";s:8:"category";s:32:"private-label-skin-care-products";s:11:"subcategory";s:12:"facials-kits";s:5:"price";d:11.18;s:6:"rating";d:4.5;s:7:"reviews";i:0;s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:57:"uploads/products/gold-skin-glow-therapy-facial-kit/01.jpg";s:11:"description";s:3659:"<h3>Description</h3><ul class="desc-steps"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> – Gold Gel Scrub: This 24-carat gold gel scrub will help reveal a smoother, clearer and youthful skin. The excellent gel having soft granules penetrate deep into the skin to clean clogged pores and removes black head from skin and skin restores softness, smoothness and radiance.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Gold Massage Cream : This 24-carat gold Massage cream that helps improve blood circulation restore softness smoothness and radiance. The excellent Massage cream improve the quality of cell regeneration and glow while making skin look younger .</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum Moisturises the skin, give extra radiance and instant whitening.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Gold Radiance Massage Gel : This 24-carat gold radiance gel helps to improve blood circulation restore softness, smoothness and radiance. The excellent gel improves the quality of cell regeneration and glow while making skin look younger.</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Gold Pack : This Gold pack contains natural extract of Liquorice Extract, Mulberry extract, aloevera extract and other precious ingredients Gold Foil that lighten the skin and control production of melanin &amp; making skin fairer and lighten facial tone.</li></ul><h4>Directions To Use</h4><ul class="desc-directions"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Apply this gel scrub lavishly all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes upward and downward strokes, Wash off with plain water.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Add 2-3 drops of Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum with the cream to apply all over face &amp; neck. Moisten hand with cold water, gently massage for 10-15 minutes &amp; remove with damp cotton.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Add 2-3 drop in Massage Cream &amp; Face Pack. Also apply after facial for extra glow.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply this gel lavishly all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes upward and downward strokes .</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply a generous amount of this pack on face and neck leaving eyes. Relax till completely dry. Rinse with plain water .</li></ul><h4>Key Ingredients</h4><p><em>*This Product is Non-Vegan Formulation*</em></p><p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p><ul class="desc-ingredients"><li>Purified Water</li><li>Glycerine</li><li>Propylene Glycol</li><li>Turmeric Extract</li><li>Liquorice (Glycyrrhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Scrub beads</li><li>Xylityglucoside</li><li>Mulberry (Morus alba)</li><li>Extract</li><li>PEG 12 Dimethicone</li><li>Carbomer</li><li>Trethanolamine</li><li>Polysorbate 20</li><li>Cinnamon Oil</li><li>Imidazolidinyl Urea</li><li>Phenoxyethanol</li><li>Perfume</li><li>Anhydroxylitol</li><li>Xylitol</li><li>24K Gold flakes</li><li>Disodium Ethylenediaminetetra Acetic Acid</li><li>Light Liquid Paraffin</li><li>Beeswax Bleached</li><li>Emulsifying Wax</li><li>Sweet Almond (Prunus amygdalus dulcis) Oil</li><li>Glyceryl Monostearate</li><li>Isopropyl Myristate</li><li>Butyrospermum Parki (Shea Butter)</li><li>Sesame Oil</li><li>Cetyl Alcohol</li><li>Ashwagandha (Withania Somnifera) Extract</li><li>Papaya (Carica papaya) Extract</li><li>Polysorbate 80</li><li>Cyclomethicone</li><li>Xylitylglucoside</li><li>Glyceryl Stearate</li><li>Polyethylene Glycol 100 Stearate Tomato (Solanum lycopersicum) Fruit Extract</li><li>DMDM hydantoin</li><li>Vitamin E</li><li>Borax</li></ul><h4>Important Considerations</h4><p><strong>Note:</strong> Use only as directed. Avoid contact with eyes. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a physician.</p>";}i:130;a:11:{s:2:"id";i:151;s:4:"slug";s:34:"fruitmix-skin-whitening-facial-kit";s:4:"name";s:34:"FRUITMIX SKIN WHITENING FACIAL KIT";s:8:"category";s:32:"private-label-skin-care-products";s:11:"subcategory";s:12:"facials-kits";s:5:"price";d:11.18;s:6:"rating";d:4.5;s:7:"reviews";i:0;s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:58:"uploads/products/fruitmix-skin-whitening-facial-kit/01.jpg";s:11:"description";s:3631:"<h3>Description</h3><ul class="desc-steps"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> – Fruit Mix Cleansing Cream : This cream contains of extract Papaya, lemon, Cucumber and Ananas Sativus which help in removing dead cells along with breaking down the inactive proteins. Thus, it leaves the skin super soft and radiant.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> – Fruit Mix Exfoliating Scrub : Enriched with the goodness of Pomegranate extract, Aloe Vera extract and Papaya extract, Cucumber extract, this formulation gently removes the dead cell of facial skin. It improves the skin complexion and lightens the patches.</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> – Fruit Mix Massage Cream: This is a rich composition of Mulberry Extract, Papaya Extract, Ananas Sativus and Vitamin E. It improves the skin complexion and nourishes it with all necessary mineral and vitamins.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> – Fruit Mix Face Pack This formulation contains Sweet Almond Oil, Bearberry Leaf Extract, Aloe vera extract, Cucumber extract, this combination not only tighten the skin pores but removes blemishes, dark spot, evens skin tone and brings a glow to the skin .</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Lightening &amp; Brightening Serum Moisturises the skin, give extra radiance and instant whitening.</li></ul><h4>Directions To Use</h4><ul class="desc-directions"><li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Apply on the face and neck and massaged gently in circular motion for 5 minutes. Wash off with fresh water and pat dry.</li><li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Apply on the face and neck, massage gently in circular direction for 5-10 minutes. Wash with fresh water, pat dry .</li><li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply all over the face and neck. Massage for 15-20 minutes in circular motion with firm upward and outward strokes. Massage until cream gets absorbed in the skin.</li><li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply a thick layer all over f ace and neck, leave it until gets dry. Rinse off with fresh water.</li><li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply a few drops of this serum on your face and tap gently with your fingertips until gets absorbed .</li></ul><h4>Key Ingredients</h4><p><em>*This Product is Non-Vegan Formulation*</em></p><p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p><ul class="desc-ingredients"><li>Sesame Oil</li><li>Sweet Almond (Prunus amygdalus dulcis) Oil</li><li>Papaya (Carica papaya) Extract</li><li>Ananas Sativus (Pineapple) Fruit Extract</li><li>Cucumber (Cucumis Sativus) Extract</li><li>Lemon (Citrus medica limonum) Extract</li><li>Aloe Vera Extract</li><li>Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter)</li><li>Pomegranate (Punica granatum) Extract</li><li>Mulberry (Morus alba) Extract</li><li>Vitamin E</li><li>Purified Water</li><li>Glycerine</li><li>Propylene Glycol</li><li>Liquorice (Glycymhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>PEG 12 Dimethicone</li><li>Carbomer</li><li>Triethanolamine</li><li>Polysorbate 20</li><li>Xylitylglucoside</li><li>Pea (Pisum sativum) Extract</li><li>Imidazolidinyl Urea</li><li>Phenoxyethanol</li><li>Fragrance</li><li>Cinnamon Oil</li><li>Anhydroxylitol</li><li>Xylitol</li><li>Hydrolyzed Pearl</li><li>Liqourice (Glycyrrhiza Glabra) Extract</li><li>Green Tea (Camellia sinensis) Extract</li><li>Sodium Acrylates Copolymer</li><li>Glycolic Acid</li><li>Xylityiglucoside</li><li>Lactic Acid</li><li>Caprylyl Glycol</li><li>Niacinamide</li><li>Xanthan Gum</li><li>Alpha Arbutin</li><li>Disodium Ethylenediaminetetra Acetic Acid</li><li>Caprylhydroxamic Acid</li></ul><h4>Important Considerations</h4><p><strong>Note:</strong> Use only as directed. Avoid contact with eyes. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a physician.</p>";}i:131;a:11:{s:2:"id";i:149;s:4:"slug";s:25:"whitening-boost-face-wash";s:4:"name";s:25:"Whitening Boost Face Wash";s:8:"category";s:32:"private-label-skin-care-products";s:11:"subcategory";s:0:"";s:5:"price";d:11.18;s:6:"rating";d:4.5;s:7:"reviews";i:0;s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:79:"uploads/products/whitening-boost-face-wash/whitening-boost-face-wash-13764.webp";s:11:"description";s:25:"Whitening Boost Face Wash";}i:132;a:11:{s:2:"id";i:148;s:4:"slug";s:44:"vitamin-c-brightening-illuminating-face-wash";s:4:"name";s:46:"VITAMIN C BRIGHTENING & ILLUMINATING FACE WASH";s:8:"category";s:32:"private-label-skin-care-products";s:11:"subcategory";s:9:"vitamin-c";s:5:"price";d:11.18;s:6:"rating";d:4.5;s:7:"reviews";i:0;s:5:"badge";s:0:"";s:5:"image";s:68:"uploads/products/vitamin-c-brightening-illuminating-face-wash/01.jpg";s:11:"description";s:88:"[PDF] Skin Care Collections/Face Wash/VITAMIN C BRIGHTENING & ILLUMINATING FACE WASH.pdf";}i:133;a:11:{s:2:"id";i:147;s:4:"slug";s:66:"salicylic-acid-2-pha-2-aha-complex-facewash-infused-with-probiotic";s:4:"name";s:70:"Salicylic Acid + 2 PHA + 2 AHA Complex Facewash Infused with Probiotic";s:8:"category";s:32:"private-label-skin-care-products";s:11:"subcategory";s:9:"face-wash";s:5:"price";d:11.18;s:6:"rating";